Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.81,0:00:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yudng!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yudng, Yudng! Yudng!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.41,0:00:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.91,0:00:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to squash these three\Nsnakes or I'm out of the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.05,0:01:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.27,0:01:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's life points are low, so\Nhe's got to protect himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.73,0:01:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick may attack with his\Nthree serpents in his next turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.53,0:01:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and Joey has to be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.31,0:01:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, what can Joey do to\Nget rid of those gross things?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.09,0:01:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.47,0:01:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The first thing that boy has to\Ndo is keep his life points safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.85,0:01:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your chances of victory have vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never recover from the triple\Nonslaught of my embodiments of a popus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.15,0:01:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.07,0:01:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to disagree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.21,0:01:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down and change\NAlligator's sword from attack to defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.91,0:01:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That seems like a final\Ndesperate move to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.15,0:01:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll just see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.09,0:01:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Personality over here attacks me,\NI'll activate my scapegoat magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.01,0:02:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll absorb the hits of all three of his\Nslimy reptiles, leaving me safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to feel what\Nreal power can accomplish, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.49,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my three beasts, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.95,0:02:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.61,0:02:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek, you're in for a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.49,0:02:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Go scapegoat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.91,0:02:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My scapegoats will absorb all\Nthree of your snake attacks. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.01,0:02:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's smarter than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.45,0:02:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Good move, but not good\Nenough. Eh? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe my magic jammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.43,0:02:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad news, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.93,0:02:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid Merrick's magic\Njammer trap card cancels
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.87,0:02:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,out the effect of Joey's\Nscapegoat magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.77,0:02:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That evil creep can't win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.11,0:02:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to say farewell to your\Nfurry friends and hello to my serpents!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.07,0:02:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm popes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.13,0:02:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Opopus, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.87,0:02:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy Rocket Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.33,0:02:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And alligator sword! Now,\Nattack his life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.31,0:03:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.57,0:03:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He almost lost the rest of his life\Npoints. You've lost all your monsters. And
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.19,0:03:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,now you're down to 200 life points One\Nmore attack and it's over You can do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised to help me defeat Merrick\Nand if you win this duel, he's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.95,0:03:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.57,0:03:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Maric, and your friend's about to\Nlose at the hands of my servant, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The end's near.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel can't end until Maric\Nplays his Egyptian God card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.29,0:03:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I must see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.49,0:03:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.81,0:03:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you made\Nit all the way to the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.85,0:03:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle City Finals just\Nto lose on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.09,0:03:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you may as well stay down,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.11,0:03:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,because I'm about to take away\Nthe few life points you have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.87,0:03:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,One more attack, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.41,0:03:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler, and your tiny portion\Nof life points will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:03:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.83,0:04:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, Joey can still\Nwin this duel, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.17,0:04:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.31,0:04:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.71,0:04:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Yeah, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.17,0:04:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, guys, I want Joey to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.45,0:04:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but the odds in this duel\Nare completely against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.55,0:04:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, Serenity,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.89,0:04:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick still has all of his life points,\Nand your brother is down to his final 200.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.19,0:04:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.11,0:04:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a slim chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but Joey might have lost hope Your brother
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,needs a serious confidence\Nboost I'd suggest
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.05,0:04:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Forfeiting to avoid\Nhumiliation. No way. Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.99,0:04:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you even think about\Nlistening to this nut job
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.39,0:04:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.75,0:04:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, is that how you got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.71,0:04:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,By just giving up when\Nthe odds were against you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.37,0:04:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did you keep on fighting\Nuntil the very end?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think about it You got a good point,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.07,0:04:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad I want some pretty\Ntough fools to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.21,0:04:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you're a Battle City finalist,\Nyou're going to throw it away?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.83,0:04:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess you'll always be a\Nrunner-up instead of a champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.37,0:05:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And your sister will always\Nremember how you wimped out. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You can still win!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.97,0:05:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.88,0:05:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anyone stronger than you,\Nand you inspire me every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.55,0:05:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If it hadn't been for you, I\Nwouldn't have gotten my sight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.97,0:05:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not because you paid for my surgery,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but because you gave me the\Ncourage to go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, when it was over,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,you gave me the strength I needed to\Ntake off my bandages and face the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.15,0:05:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,When everything was\Ndark, you gave me light.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.69,0:05:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never given up before,\Nand you shouldn't start today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you never had anyone who\Ncared about you like that, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.31,0:05:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I did, but that was a\Ntime so very long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.61,0:05:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A baby in these parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.79,0:06:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you poor sweet child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would leave you all alone in the cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.69,0:06:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's much warmer down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.01,0:06:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My child. She rescued\Nme from the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.09,0:06:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and cared for me as if I\Nwere her own So yes, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler, I know what it's\Nlike to be loved Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,you always pull through and I know you\Ncan beat him Thanks, sis All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.87,0:06:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,then Are you going to stay down\Non your knees and accept defeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Or be a fool and prolong your\Nsuffering by making a move?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest you give in and\Nface reality. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.09,0:06:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come too far to give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.19,0:06:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if I quit, I'll be letting\Ndown everyone who ever believed in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention letting\Nmyself down. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.53,0:06:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been in tighter spots,\Nand I still pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.17,0:06:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzo, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.71,0:06:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to your life points, Nova.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.57,0:07:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not great, Robert!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to exterminate your insect queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.29,0:07:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there goes my best problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fisherman's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck in the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.59,0:07:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you're all right, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I fought my hardest to\Nget where I am right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And I never let anyone get the best\Nof me, even when all hope seemed lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So why should I start now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.95,0:07:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mary, you think I'm\Ngoing to lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.73,0:07:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you better guess again, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.33,0:07:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to the finals\Nfor one reason, to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.25,0:07:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's what I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.75,0:07:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, wheel is back! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go! Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I defeated three of the toughest duelists\Nout there to earn my way onto this flip,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.77,0:07:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you lightbulb head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not gonna let you or your shiny\Nskull stop me from finishing what I started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.53,0:07:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.85,0:07:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, guys. You rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:07:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, I'll win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.61,0:07:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you're more\Nfoolish than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for you to lose shamefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.97,0:08:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So make your final pathetic move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to remind Joey of\Nthe importance of his victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.73,0:08:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Save the world. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.41,0:08:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If I beat Merrick, his plans are crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The power is in your hands. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your scheme ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised Yugi that I'd help him\Nstop you from achieving whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,sick and twisted goals that you and\Nyour rare hunters have, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.61,0:08:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna keep that promise by knocking\Nyour bald cranium out of the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.59,0:08:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes. All right. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.71,0:08:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you're ready to say\Ngoodbye to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.91,0:08:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Your false threats don't frighten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.33,0:08:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I place two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I summon Swords of\NRevealing Light in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.13,0:08:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now back to you, Sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.07,0:09:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,His determination is surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.19,0:09:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he retaliate with\Nonly 200 life points?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.87,0:09:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My serpent swordsman will\Neasily finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for,\Nyou incompetent buffoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.03,0:09:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.95,0:09:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you've enjoyed your brief\Nexperience as a Battle City finalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my embodiments\Nof a popis. Triple attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.53,0:09:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.01,0:09:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to skin your snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So, go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.97,0:09:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My Foolish Burial Magic card lets me put\None card from my hand into your graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I'm going to reveal this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.11,0:09:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My Trap Card, Grave Robber.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.43,0:09:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you plan to rob my graveyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, did you figure that out all by yourself\Nor did someone hand you a cheat sheet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.87,0:09:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Einstein, I'm\Ngoing to rob your grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.19,0:09:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And look, I've taken back\Nthe card I just put in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.13,0:09:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, reveal Jinzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.77,0:10:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He summoned an extremely powerful\Nmonster to the field. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I remembered your snake\Ncreatures were a special
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.23,0:10:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,breed of monsters that also\Nhappened to be trap cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.47,0:10:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your slimy reptiles have all\Nthe strengths of trap cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.93,0:10:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but they have all the weaknesses,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.51,0:10:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.61,0:10:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Weaknesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.67,0:10:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzo's special ability\Nlets him destroy trap cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.01,0:10:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzo, wipe out his serpents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.91,0:10:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I won Jinzo in my very first Battle\NCity duel against a real opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.15,0:10:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the way, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.21,0:10:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Joey seems to be using what\Nhe's learned from his past victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.91,0:10:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, do you still think I'm an\Namateur or did you learn your lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.99,0:10:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not through with you yet, Mr. Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.11,0:10:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have all my life\Npoints. Not for long, Maric.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.21,0:11:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,See,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,With my man Jinzo by my side, you and your
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.05,0:11:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,trap cards are ancient\Nhistory Oh yeah Joey, you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.59,0:11:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that you'd pull\Nthrough Now show him
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.73,0:11:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,who's boss If it weren't for all my battle
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.93,0:11:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,city victories I wouldn't\Nbe here right now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I won Jinzo by defeating Esperoba. And now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,his card is giving me the strength to beat
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.93,0:11:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Maric looks like Wheeler\Ngot lucky. Perhaps
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.91,0:11:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll survive this duel long enough for me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.99,0:11:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,to see Marek's Egyptian\NGod card after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out, Baldwanda!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon Battle\NWarrior in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.61,0:11:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, 'cause that's not all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.21,0:11:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I also switch my Swordsman\Nof Landstar into attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.15,0:11:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And then there's Jinzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.87,0:11:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.93,0:12:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Battle Warrior and Swordsman of\NLandstar move in with a direct attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.11,0:12:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He got Maric's life points down to 400.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.61,0:12:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing I inspired him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.93,0:12:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You the man, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.03,0:12:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.73,0:12:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it! You rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.81,0:12:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, you don't feel so tough, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.85,0:12:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should have protected\Nyourself a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.35,0:12:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack me all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.03,0:12:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, I still possess\Nmy Temple of the Kings card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.49,0:12:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A card that has ancient powers\Nso strong, it can't be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.37,0:12:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait until you experience\Nits unparalleled force.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.01,0:12:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Your palace doesn't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've already\Nproven that, Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't sit back and let\Npeople walk all over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.41,0:12:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So bring it on. Hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take whatever you got\Nand dish it right back, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:12:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So go ahead and make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.07,0:13:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,With great pleasure, foolish boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You've allowed Joey\NWheeler to come too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.47,0:13:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now destroy him at once or\Nface severe consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's worthless, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.13,0:13:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.23,0:13:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't disappoint you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.03,0:13:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I've already figured out a\Nway to render his monsters useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.25,0:13:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Bedetta. Head?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.79,0:13:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the holdup?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.87,0:13:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This should hold you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.49,0:13:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I play my Swords of Revealing Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.19,0:13:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the deal, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.89,0:13:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's Swords of Revealing Light traps\NJoey's monsters for three whole turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.53,0:13:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But Joey can still win, right? I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But not attacking for\Nthree turns won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.47,0:13:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true, Mai, but Joey can still sacrifice\Nhis monsters to summon stronger ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:13:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and although his Jinzo can't attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.25,0:14:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,its special ability does remain in effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Merrick still\Ncan't use his trap cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.39,0:14:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.37,0:14:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.37,0:14:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.99,0:14:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not be able to attack,\Nbut I can still do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice my battle warrior in order\Nto summon the legendary fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.57,0:14:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how much this card meant to you,\NMako, and I promised you I'd use it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.11,0:14:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And before I end my turn, I'll switch\Nall three of my monsters to defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.05,0:14:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.19,0:14:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.75,0:14:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you seem so shocked, Odeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.47,0:14:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're posing as me, you should\Nhave my card in your deck, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.77,0:14:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I slipped\Nit in before the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.41,0:14:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,this card is too dangerous, and I'm\Nnot meant to control its great power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.01,0:14:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly expect me to play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.55,0:14:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Please reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.07,0:14:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:14:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop whimpering.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.17,0:15:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound pitiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I command you to play that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.85,0:15:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.41,0:15:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You must place it within the\Nancient ark on the temple steps,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.15,0:15:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and when the time is right,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you will release its rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Marek, I'm getting\Ntired of waiting around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll place this card\Nface down on the playing field.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.29,0:15:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now prepare yourself, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.97,0:15:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler, for the next card I play will be\Nthe final instrument of your destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, play the card I added to your deck\Nright now. As soon as you place it within
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.43,0:15:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The sacred arc on the temple steps. You'll
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.23,0:15:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,be invincible And if\Nyou refuse to play it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.69,0:15:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have to answer to\Nme The choice is yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.41,0:15:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, don't be a fool. I must obey,\NMaster Merrick. It is my sworn duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.47,0:16:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Something strange is\Ngoing on up there, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks really freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Taya's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.77,0:16:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since Merrick drew his last\Ncard, he's been acting really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.23,0:16:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it has something to do\Nwith that ancient temple behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.35,0:16:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,When he first played Temple of the Kings,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a bad feeling about that\Nbox at the top of the stairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.09,0:16:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,the one with the Egyptian symbols on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.85,0:16:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.27,0:16:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,For some weird reason,\Nit seems familiar to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.09,0:16:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not sure why Be careful, Joey Man,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.05,0:16:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,this is like the longest\Nmove in history Good
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.57,0:16:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,moves take time But how\Nwould you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I seal this card In\Nthe sacred Ark of the Temple
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoop-dee-doo! You have no idea what\NI've just done by securing this all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Powerful card within my ancient sanctuary.\NBy sealing this Card of the Gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.91,0:16:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have also sealed Your fate Card\Nof the Gods That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:16:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A wise move, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.43,0:17:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to bring back a monster from\Nmy graveyard with Monster Reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.87,0:17:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring back my alligator's sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.73,0:17:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.13,0:17:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice my Alligator Sword and my\NSwordsman of Landstar so I can summon this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My insect queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.83,0:17:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I won this card from a feisty\Nlittle germ named Weevil Underwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.85,0:17:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of my Battle City\Nvictories is paying off right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Those duels got me three\Nincredible monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My tournament's done\Nwonders for Wheeler's deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.09,0:17:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.31,0:17:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey was able to summon every rare monster\Nhe won in the tournament all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Joey has come a long way as a duelist\Nsince the Battle City Tournament began,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.45,0:18:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out, Maric,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.57,0:18:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,because your Swords of Revealing\NLight will lose their power next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.05,0:18:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And when those lights go out, there'll\Nbe nothing holding my monsters back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you have nothing to\Nprotect you, you're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You think just because you were able to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.77,0:18:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,acquire a few strong\Nmonsters you can defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.91,0:18:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so naive, for I am about to\Nsummon a beast that you can't destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.07,0:18:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.93,0:18:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,While your monsters were trapped\Nin my swords of revealing light,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to prepare for the\Narrival of my ancient creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.03,0:18:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And this all-powerful entity will serve as
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.93,0:18:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the guardian of the sacred\NTemple of the Kings,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.89,0:18:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,protecting my ancient sanctuary and\Nall of the secrets that lie within.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.47,0:18:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Say that again with small words.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.59,0:18:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.77,0:18:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I play this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.65,0:18:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Cop of Sealed Souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.37,0:18:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I reveal my face-down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Seal of Circuit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.55,0:18:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,When these two magic cards are played\Nalong with Temple of the Kings,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.61,0:19:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,they are able to awaken a great\Ncreature from its ancient slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A being like none you've ever seen before!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.47,0:19:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he? Patience!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.31,0:19:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hear my call,\NGuardian of the Temple!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.35,0:19:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mystical Beast of Circuit, I summon thee!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a bad feeling about this, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.49,0:19:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's tremendous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.39,0:19:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.01,0:19:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That creature is minute compared to\Nwhat lurks within my sacred temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.15,0:19:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me, now, what monster did\Nyou hide inside that ark, Marek?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Within the sacred ark lies my Egyptian\Ngod guard, the winged dragon of Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,With that thing outside and\Nhis Egyptian god caught inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.95,0:19:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way I can win!
